      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Я согласна.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I agree.' Notice how 'I' sets up the clause and leads naturally into 'agree'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
